@title First-run setup, then the main menu and TIME ATTACK SELECTION
@game  PCSE00001

# The whole first-run wizard is mandatory (the team choice is one-time and offline), and
# every screen in it is TOUCH driven - the buttons are not pad-selectable. Panel
# coordinates are screen*2. Verified end to end with
#   VITASLOP_GXP_LIVE=1 VITASLOP_HEADLESS_RECIPE=<this> VITASLOP_HEADLESS_FRAMES=11000 \
#   VITASLOP_HEADLESS_SHOT_EVERY=200 vitaslop-desktop --game <app> --headless <dir>
# `play` renders in SOFTWARE and shows this title as black - judge it only through the
# headless GPU path.

0: @section boot

# PLAY on the title screen (screen 480,420 -> panel 960,840)
1500: touch=960,840
1520:
1560: touch=960,840
1580:

# PLANETARY LEAGUE -> SIGN ON (screen 480,437 -> panel 960,874). Despite the name this
# is NOT a PlayStation Network sign-in; it proceeds with no account and no network.
1700: touch=960,874
1720:
1780: touch=960,874
1800:

# TEAMS: "Touch the ticket to sign the contract" - ticket centre screen (200,270).
2000: touch=400,540
2020:
2100: touch=400,540
2120:

# TEAM CONFIRMATION: "touch and HOLD the team icon". A tap does nothing.
2400: touch=960,556
2600:

# The hold issues a TEAM ID card. The cyan "OK" box on the card is NOT the control - the
# ticker says "touch the arrow on the right", and an `explore` sweep at f2700 proved it:
# the OK box and the card body both bucket as NO EFFECT, while the right-edge arrow at
# panel (1870,516) produces a distinct signature. Do not re-try the OK box.
2700: touch=1870,516
2740:
2820: touch=1870,516
2860:

# SIGNING COMPLETE -> NEXT (screen 480,437 -> panel 960,874).
3200: touch=960,874
3240:

# From here the setup screens (LOCATION INFO, ...) advance on the RIGHT-EDGE ARROW at
# screen (935,270) -> panel (1870,540), not on any centre button. Walk them.
3500: touch=1870,540
3540:
3700: touch=1870,540
3740:
# "Now creating your ID Card..." offers USE LOCATION TRACKER (screen 480,362) or FIND
# LOCATION ON MAP (screen 480,439). The right arrow does NOT advance this one - it needs a
# choice. Take the map, which is the offline path: the tracker wants a real position fix.
3900: touch=960,878
3940:
4000: touch=960,878
4040:

# Then place the marker on the world map and confirm with the right-edge arrow.
4200: touch=960,540
4240:
4400: touch=1870,540
4440:
4600: touch=1870,540
4640:
4800: touch=960,874
4840:
5000: touch=960,874
5040:

# COUNTRY/REGION list, "Other" -> the single entry "RID / Ridge State" at screen (480,157).
5200: touch=960,314
5240:
5350: touch=960,314
5390:

# Confirm out of the region list and on through whatever the wizard has left.
5550: touch=1870,540
5590:
5750: touch=960,874
5790:
5950: touch=1870,540
5990:
6150: touch=960,874
6190:

# SETTINGS COMPLETE - "Touch READY on the right side to begin." The READY button is the
# big arrow panel at screen (826,276) -> panel (1652,552).
6400: touch=1652,552
6440:
6600: touch=1652,552
6640:

# Team trophy + RCTV PLANET NEWS ticker; the right-edge arrow dismisses it to the MAIN MENU.
7000: touch=1870,540
7040:
7300: touch=1870,540
7340:
# MAIN MENU: GARAGE | WORLD RACE | SPOT... | TIME ... - take the TIME card (screen 930,415).
7600: touch=1860,830
7640:
7900: touch=1860,830
7940:
8300: touch=960,540
8340:
8700: touch=960,874
8740:
9100: touch=1870,540
9140:
